    {
      "uid": "zhcn:714861369d33ff74f0affa10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我为干劲十足的新宇宙加油。\n期待有一天能看见她在镇上\n和朋友一起玩游戏的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a38f7ae7e0e0e624df459031a6e196fb42dfbd2c1681cd143e3f58f78486ce2",
