    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68c096eb2625fba655ae2370",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那我们去学怎么玩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ca793490216463acbb2597bda0abd4ee15ab05fb03725e982de497d97e5bd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105705.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd5241968785dae96c0cdd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为不熟悉游戏，所以没办法一起玩。\n她是这个意思吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ec7d41b377a15cc1f61ff7ec09e315d7e8f2c833935f2d2e5fdf84b2e695eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105705.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b6a946476612db047fc0ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先是卡拉OK。\n我教她怎么用评分模式后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "83c27dbb83f9aa10166643c5b310b061bb43498cb433224f104d1883695561f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105705.json",
      "json_path": [
